      "gap": 6,
      "padding": [
        10,
        12
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VazTY",
          "name": "Label",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "content": "ANNOTATION · NOT IN THE UI",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "700",
          "letterSpacing": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DRikX",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "List order is for reading only. A conflict is flagged in place and the player marks which rule wins or adds an exception; the diagnostics view isn't drawn yet (O).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UyeOp",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Each rule's percentage is its own wager's house edge under these table rules (spec 1 A1 B). No strategy-level blended edge or worst-case estimate; \"At risk on the table\" is the stake in this preview situation only (P).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WVIn0",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Stopping rules are cycle-scoped: cycle profit or loss and turns in the cycle. Stopping new bets leads to final settlement, and a new cycle always needs an explicit restart. No session or since-start scope in MVP (S).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "eANg9",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Header (spec 4 Amendment 1): Save revision is the explicit save; drafts autosave. Submit to community appears only for a saved revision, and spec 6 decides its gating (M). Drafts are never shared (L). Test in practice opens guided-practice setup with the latest saved revision; nothing starts or charges until Start, and there is no fixed-length test (R).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "BiJd0",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Strategy note: the author's own prose, labelled as theirs, shown after a correction apart from the coach's explanation, never during Check, and never changes behaviour (T).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
