          "content": "Amounts are flagged, never rescaled. The copy declares this table, so an amount below its own declared minimum makes it not runnable: Save revision is blocked and the problem is listed (spec 4 Q1, decided). Test in practice needs a saved revision, so it's off too. Only incompatibility with a different table (a session's table, S4-13 setup) is allowed and never blocks saving.",
