          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Each step shows the state (stake, balance, counters) as an explanation trail. No net, total or average anywhere. Fixed preview stream; nothing is recorded or charged. After the point is made the next roll is a come-out roll: place bets are off by default, so a 7 doesn't lose Place 8. It stays outstanding until the cycle ends, when it comes down (removable).",
