        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "MHNto",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Online only. The current grant keeps its expiry; the first reset in the new timezone is that zone's next midnight strictly after the expiry. No extra grant is created. Example with today = Oct 18: today's grant expires 12:00 AM Mountain Time on Oct 19 (11:00 PM Pacific on Oct 18), so the first Pacific reset is 12:00 AM Pacific Time on Oct 19. The picker offers the full timezone list with US zones first (spec 5 Q8).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
