    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "fIExY",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 52344,
      "name": "Annotation — S5-07 Move allowance here (not UI)",
      "width": 560,
      "stroke": "$--annotation",
      "strokeWidth": {
        "left": 2
      },
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 6,
      "padding": [
        10,
        12
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "at4L6",
          "name": "Label",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "content": "ANNOTATION · NOT IN THE UI",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "700",
          "letterSpacing": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "D9zCj",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Started online on the receiving device; it creates a pending request. From the moment the iPhone learns of the request it durably freezes new spending from today's grant, so the remainder stays 4:05 through the move; a lost acknowledgement keeps it frozen until it retrieves the transfer receipt. The iPhone completes the move on its next connected reconciliation: a guided session using the grant ends with final settlement, then it uploads all usage and releases the remainder. The server issues a transfer grant with the remainder (minutes, turns or unallocated bankroll, plus unused attempts) and the same expiry. A charged, unfinished challenge stays and can finish on the original device. Cancelling needs a connection: it's a new authoritative operation proving where the balance is (offline states on the right). A transfer never creates a fresh daily amount. No tab bar under the dialog.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "RmzJ7",
      "x": 4050,
      "y": 52368,
      "name": "Annotation — S5-07 · original device (not UI)",
      "width": 390,
      "stroke": "$--annotation",
      "strokeWidth": {
        "left": 2
      },
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 6,
      "padding": [
        10,
        12
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VYK9T",
          "name": "Label",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "content": "ANNOTATION · NOT IN THE UI",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "700",
          "letterSpacing": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LofGq",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Shown on the original device when a transfer is requested during a guided session. Spending from the grant froze at the request (the remainder stays 4:05 through the move), so play can't continue on the allowance and Hit/Stand/Double are replaced. End session runs the normal stop path (removable wagers returned, final settlement, results); End and play free does the same, then opens free play. The transfer completes on reconciliation after the session ends.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "S2M3E",
      "x": 5400,
      "y": 52368,
      "name": "Annotation — S5-08 Replace a lost device (not UI)",
      "width": 390,
      "stroke": "$--annotation",
      "strokeWidth": {
        "left": 2
      },
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 6,
      "padding": [
        10,
        12
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "JL3VW",
          "name": "Label",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "content": "ANNOTATION · NOT IN THE UI",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "700",
          "letterSpacing": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xigUh",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Online, from any signed-in installation. Moves the designation immediately. The replacement gets grants from the next allowance day only, never today's. The replaced device's grant requests are denied from now on. If the old device still held a current grant, it would expire at its original instant (no overlap) and could still be transferred if that device reconnects; here it last synced Oct 12, so it holds nothing for today. A reinstall is a new installation and uses this or a transfer. Device names are shown only to the account owner (spec 5 Q4).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
