          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The line comes from the account's current policy: time (S5-10 Blackjack), turns (Craps) or training bankroll (Roulette). Premium shows “Unlimited training (premium)”. Admission never charges; nothing is used until Start. Setup may link to See premium; nothing promotes premium during play. S5-10 supersedes the S1-02 originals for allowance lines (spec 5 Q7).",
