          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Bankroll policy only: no buy-in field and no rebuys. At start the whole available bankroll is allocated to the session; its cash-out returns at the end (remaining = granted − allocations + returns). Net result and drawdown use the allocated amount. Free play and premium keep ordinary practice funding.",
