          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Shown once the stop path has finished, and only when nothing more can be used: time or turns at 0, or a training bankroll that can't fund any legal opening wager at any launch table (0 units here; 4 units would still be a shortfall). Offers results, unlimited free play, See premium and the reset time (the grant's actual expiry). When challenge attempts remain it may point to them (spec 5 Q9) using the Amendment 1 E Counting string. Upgrade prompts are allowed here. A started challenge still finishes with no further charge.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
