          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Spec 1's access-ended stop: finish the turn (with coaching for time or turn exhaustion), return removable wagers, settle the rest automatically, then results. Settlement is never charged and its winnings never reopen time or turns. The same pattern serves premium confirmed ended, the offline deadline passed and usable internet lost.",
