          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Grant expiry at the daily reset stops guided sessions; old bankroll results stay with this session. ADS: an interstitial may appear only when the player leaves a fresh S1-10 or S3-08 result produced in this app session, after it's durably saved, at most once per 10 minutes on trusted elapsed time. Never for teens, unresolved ages, restricted states or premium (no SDK started), never offline, and never on Saved session detail (S4-17), reopened results, cycle results, lessons, records or Plan. If not ready, it's skipped with no delay.",
