        12
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "c29PCi",
          "name": "Label",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "content": "ANNOTATION · NOT IN THE UI",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "700",
          "letterSpacing": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "IE9Cb",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "An account-service error alone never proves the internet is gone; already-authorized play isn't interrupted by routine backend errors. The banner sits on Home without blocking the selected offline game.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "aQRjy",
      "x": 1350,
      "y": 58168,
      "name": "Annotation — S5-15 Online authorization lost (not UI)",
      "width": 390,
      "stroke": "$--annotation",
      "strokeWidth": {
        "left": 2
      },
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 6,
      "padding": [
        10,
        12
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "T6bp5l",
          "name": "Label",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "content": "ANNOTATION · NOT IN THE UI",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "700",
          "letterSpacing": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tApKj",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Online authorization uncertain (spec 5 Amendment 1 A1): probes run every 30 s with a 5 s timeout and fall back to the other endpoint. Two unsuccessful checks, or evidence older than 60 s, make connectivity uncertain → suspend at the turn boundary: the started roll finishes, then the session saves and pauses with bets in place. Nothing new starts. It resumes automatically after successful probes (next frame), or End session runs final settlement offline. One failed probe never pauses play. Only a confirmed end of a right stops; a charged challenge attempt is exempt and finishes.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "zyVfq",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 58168,
      "name": "Annotation — S5-15 Reconnect to verify access (not UI)",
      "width": 390,
      "stroke": "$--annotation",
      "strokeWidth": {
        "left": 2
      },
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 6,
      "padding": [
        10,
        12
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "M7FBnU",
          "name": "Label",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "content": "ANNOTATION · NOT IN THE UI",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "700",
          "letterSpacing": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "eS9cn",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Uncertain time → suspend at the turn boundary: the started hand finishes, the session is saved and paused, and nothing new starts. It resumes automatically once trust is re-established (a successful check or a fresh anchor). End session runs the stop path offline even while time is uncertain; suspension never starts settlement by itself.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
