        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Y4qxXF",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Google Play: 7-day billing grace (Apple's is 16 days, see the App Store billing issue). After grace, Google's automatic account hold (up to 53 days) grants nothing: the account is Free, premium benefits are paused, and premium returns once Google Play confirms payment. When the hold ends unpaid, Google Play cancels the subscription. Pause is disabled. Dates: today = Oct 18, renewal failed Oct 18, grace ends Oct 25, hold ends Dec 17.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
