          "content": "Cross-platform restore (story 10): once Tableside has verified a purchase, premium follows the account on every platform with no restore needed. Restore only checks the store account on this device, so a purchase made in the other store needs that store's access to restore it. Mirror copy on iPhone: \"A subscription bought on Google Play needs Google Play to restore it: open Tableside on an Android device signed in to the Google account that bought it…\". Google Play version of the not-linked message is on the right.",
