          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Spec 5 Amendment 1 A2: the post-results interstitial may show on ANY exit from a session result (S1-10) or challenge result (S3-08) in the current app process, including a tab-bar tap (here Home), Back to Home and New session. At most one per 10 minutes, skipped if no ad is ready, and it never delays the exit. Closing it lands on the destination the player chose. Never shown to teens, unresolved ages, restricted accounts or premium, when offline, or if ad configuration failed: those exits go straight to the destination (right). Ads are non-personalized; Report an ad (More → Help & support) keeps the last ad's reference for 24 hours.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
