          "content": "Popular counts distinct players with a qualifying session (ended, fully settled, at least 20 resolved wagers) in the preceding 30 UTC days: once per person per listing across revisions, contributing sessions only, never the author's own. Ties: original publication time, then listing ID. No search, trending or badges. Browsing needs a connection; pages are cached for the current view only. With a profile selected, each card shows that profile's evidence state; with Any table it shows how many compatible profiles are complete.",
