          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One revision × profile. Mean final net is shown in base units and as % of the 1,000 start; with a 10-unit base those two numbers are always identical (flagged on NOTES). Every share names its denominator. Session-event intervals are Wilson, or Clopper–Pearson under 5 occurrences or non-occurrences; W/L/P intervals use the delta method. A literal zero balance is listed separately from “couldn't fund the next required bet”.",
