          "content": "Reading: “non-final” covers every state without a usable result, so Incomplete, Failed and Quarantined also carry the practise line. Evaluation unavailable covers switch off, prohibited and allocation lost with one generic sentence. Waiting and Queued make no time promise; Exceeds current capacity never promises next month.",
