          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "New frame; the original S4-01 (K1iWv) is unchanged. Saved community strategies are listed under Community in the library and setup picker. Row states: update available (adopting writes a new revision of the saved item), text removed by moderation (cached text deleted on sync), deleted author (prose purged), and disabled after a required removal. Scheduled deletion hides prose and attribution until resolved (not drawn).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
