          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Totals against $50 (alert), $90 (admission: incurred + authorized + reserved + candidate) and $100 (every attempt's envelope must fit). Shows held, paused and over-capacity counts with reasons, latency misses, account holds separately, and the 24-hour backlog alert. Bar: $1 = 11 px.",
